    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblin's flute\" or a \"goblin orchestra\"? I was just asking about the acoustics and frequency stuff. Can you stick to the physics of the overtones and how the harmonic series works in the air column?",
      "source": "evaluator"
